Package: clipforge-desktop
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg, libxkbcommon0, libvulkan1, libdbus-1-3
Recommends: gpu-screen-recorder
Maintainer: ClipForge Contributors <maintainers@clipforge.invalid>
Description: Open-source Linux game clipping and replay-buffer application
 ClipForge captures gameplay via GPU Screen Recorder, manages a local SQLite
 clip library, trims clips with FFmpeg, and optionally shares clips via
 clipforge-server.
